	abstract = {GPUs pose an attractive opportunity for delivering high-performance applications. However, GPU codes are often limited due to memory contention, resulting in overall performance degradation. Since GPU scheduling is transparent to the user, and GPU memory architectures are very complex compared to ones on CPUs, finding such bottlenecks is a very cumbersome process.},
